24Z","closed_at":"2025-03-11T21:48:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nTested in 4.3.stable as well as 4.4.stable. Same results.\n\n### System information\n\nDebian 12 - Godot 4.4.stable\n\n### Issue description\n\nAccording to the docs, BROTLI should work\nWhen using PackedByteArray.decompress_dynamic specifically with FASTLZ, ZSTD, or BROTLI compressed data, the function fails:\n```gdscript\nvar test_data = PackedByteArray([ 123, 34, 0, 0, 4, 123, 3 ])\nprint(test_data)\n\n# example failure mode\nvar method = FileAccess.COMPRESSION_BROTLI\n\ntest_data = test_data.compress(method)\ntest_data = test_data.decompress_dynamic(-1, method)\n\nprint(test_data)\n```\nOtherwise it is successful:\n```gdscript\n# example success mode\nvar method = FileAccess.COMPRESSION_DEFLATE\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate new project (default settings).\nCreate root scene with a single Node.\nCreate a script for this node.\nPut the above code in ready().\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19195333/test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"blocktaster","id":76709140,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NzA5MTQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/76709140?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blocktaster","html_url":"https://github.com/blocktaster","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blocktaster/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blocktaster/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blocktaster/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blocktaster/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blocktaster/subscriptions","organizations